      "writtenOn": "2021-03-02T08:29:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks weired to me that some errors are passed via exception but the success is passed via callback.\nTo me they should be unified.\nNo strong opinion since it might be an overkill for simple argument check like this.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5095,
